wable energy project deployment and increased component costs by 15-25% in 2021-2022\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/articles/global-supply-chains-of-solar-pv-panels\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Recycling infrastructure for renewable energy components (solar panels, wind blades, batteries) is developing but remains limited, with only 5-10% of solar panels currently recycled globally\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.irena.org/publications/2020/Jun/Global-Renewables-Status-Report-2020\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
